OL,3,AHarry and Meghan's security
OL,4,Aarrangements a private matter, PM says
OL,5,
OL,6,FSecurity for the couple has long been a
OL,7,Fpoint of tension, with Prince Harry
OL,8,Flosing a legal challenge over the
OL,9,Flevels of security he and his family
OL,10,Fare entitled to while in the UK last
OL,11,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
