OL,3,ACan I get a paper remarked? What should
OL,4,AI do next? We answer your questions on
OL,5,AGCSE results day
OL,6,
OL,7,FOur team of experts is currently
OL,8,Fanswering your questions on what to do
OL,9,Fnow you've received your GCSE results
OL,11,FHundreds of thousands of students have
OL,12,Fopened their GCSE, BTec and Cambridge
OL,13,FNationals results - here's what you
OL,14,Fneed to know on things like getting
OL,15,Fyour paper remarked and if you've done
OL,16,Fbetter than expected
OL,18,FThe overall pass rate has fallen
OL,19,Fslightly for the fifth year in a row -
OL,20,Fbut top grades have edged up across
OL,21,FEngland, Wales and Northern Ireland
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
