OL,3,APeople smuggler exposed by BBC
OL,4,Ainvestigation arrested and charged
OL,5,
OL,6,FA convicted people smuggler who was
OL,7,Ffound by the BBC to be living in
OL,8,FLeicestershire has been arrested and
OL,9,Fcharged with immigration offences.
OL,11,FTwana Jamal Khdir, an Iraqi national
OL,12,Fwho was once described as "the
OL,13,Fgodfather" of the French migrant camps,
OL,14,Fpreviously served a sentence for people
OL,15,Fsmuggling in France.
OL,17,FLast month, the BBC revealed he was now
OL,18,Fliving in the UK.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
