OL,3,APeople smuggler exposed by BBC
OL,4,Ainvestigation arrested and charged
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BBC has been told he was arrested
OL,7,Fon Tuesday near Uppingham in a joint
OL,8,Foperation led by the Midlands Criminal
OL,9,FFinancial Investigations team, with the
OL,10,Fsupport of Leicestershire Police.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
