OL,4,Aafter royal parentage confirmed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe new prince has had several years to
OL,7,Fget used to the idea of having a royal
OL,8,Ffather, and he said recently he was not
OL,9,Fyet sure he would begin using his
OL,10,Ffather's name Saxe-Coburg.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
